      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/28/1/377/4",
      "text": [
        ": حدثنا سعد بن عبد الله، عن أحمد بن محمد بن عيسى عن أحمد بن محمد بن أبي نصر البزنطي قال: قال أبو الحسن عليه السلام في قول الله عز وجل: \" ثم ليقضوا تفثهم وليوفوا نذورهم \" قال: التفث تقليم الأظفار وطرح الوسخ وطرح الاحرام عنه."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.basel-kadem": [
          "4.\tWe were told by my father, may Allah grant him mercy, that he said: We were told by Sa’d bin Abdullah, from Ahmad bin Muhammed bin Isa, from Ahmad bin Muhammed bin Abi Nasr al-Bazanti, that he said: Abu’l-Hasan, peace be upon him, said with regards to the saying of Allah, Exalted and Glorious is He: «Then, let them end their tafath, and let them fulfill their vows» <a href=\"/books/quran:22#h29\">[22:29]</a>. He said: Tafath is the cutting of trim the tails, casting filth and the casting of the Ihram [1] from it."
        ]
      }
